    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>If you're hit by an attack roll made with a Ranged or Thrown weapon while wearing these gloves, you can take a Reaction to reduce the damage by 1d10 plus your Dexterity modifier if you have a free hand. If you reduce the damage to 0, you can catch the ammunition or weapon if it is small enough for you to hold in that hand.</p><p><em>Automation (midi-qol entries):</em> offered as a reaction when a ranged weapon attack (or a thrown weapon) damages you: 1d10 + your Dexterity modifier less damage; catching the missile is the GM's.</p>",
